/**
 * Measurements of the cleaned figure (`/models/human-expansion/figure.glb`),
 * used to keep the procedural network INSIDE the body. The figure is 2 units
 * tall, feet on y = 0, centred on x = 0 / z = 0, facing +z. Generated from the
 * final mesh by a local measurement script; do not edit by hand. Re-measure
 * if the model is ever replaced.
 *
 * The right-hand side (x > 0) is measured; the left is its mirror (the figure
 * is symmetric to within 0.3 percent). Where the arms merge with the torso
 * (shoulders and upper chest) the half-width is the torso's own, read from the
 * silhouette rather than the merged outline.
 */

